    "description": "Dashboards and detections for WALLIX Bastion privileged access. Four Dashboard Studio views over the privileged access estate, session content, the administration audit trail and the security signals, plus nine detections shipped unscheduled so each can be run by hand and its threshold judged before it is enabled. Pure configuration: no scripts, no binaries. Requires TA-wallix-bastion for parsing.",
